om2
note D1 (program mode): eight hoistable constants in a constant-count loop, then argcnt, which reads
note argv through x27. Hoisting stops at x26 (hzcap 7), so this exits 1 (argcnt with no arguments)
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4
s = add s 10001
s = add s 10002
s = add s 10003
s = add s 10004
s = add s 10005
s = add s 10006
s = add s 10007
s = add s 10008
end
n = argcnt
ret int add and s 0 ulong n
end
